  (text "RV1 (B10k DRIVE): Knob DRIVE. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nR19, R20, R21, R22, R23, R24 (1k): Knob filter R\nC33, C34, C35, C36, C37, C38 (100nF): Knob filter C: steadies the ADC reading\nRV2 (B10k TONE): Knob TONE. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nRV3 (B10k RATE): Knob RATE. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nRV4 (B10k DEPTH): Knob DEPTH. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nRV5 (B10k TIME): Knob TIME. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nRV6 (B10k REPEATS): Knob REPEATS. CCW end to GND, CW end to 3.3 V\nJ6 (FOOTSWITCHES): Three momentary (soft-touch) SPST footswitches: each one between pin 1/2/3 and pin 4 (GND)\nR25, R26, R27 (1k): Protects the MCU pin from static on the switch wire\nC39, C40, C41 (100nF): Hardware debounce + noise filter\nR28, R29, R30 (470): LED current limit: (3.3-2.0)/470 = 2.8 mA\nD3 (LED OD red): Status LED for OD\nD4 (LED TREM yellow): Status LED for TREM\nD5 (LED DELAY green): Status LED for DELAY"
